solution.p:
Substitute -6 in for the variable p and simplify:
\begin{aligned}
\amp{-4\mathopen{}\left(-6-2\right)-7}\\
\amp={-4\cdot \left(-8\right)+\left(-7\right)}\\
\amp={32+\left(-7\right)}\\
\amp={25}
\end{aligned}

